---
description: Analysis SQL in db/analysis
globs: db/analysis/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Bucket days and months with AT TIME ZONE 'Asia/Jakarta'. Never UTC.
- Count quotes with COUNT(DISTINCT quote_id); payoff_events has several rows per quote.
- No NIK, phone, email or bank account in any output column.
- Write every assumption as a SQL comment at the top.
- Amounts are whole rupiah; don't divide money without saying how it is rounded.
